plugin-system.firmware-summary = Whether firmware updates can be delivered.
firmware-missing-title = The firmware update service is not installed
firmware-missing-summary = fwupd is not installed, so firmware updates from the maker (BIOS, SSD, devices) never reach this computer. Install it with your package manager.
firmware-timer-title = The firmware list is not refreshed automatically
firmware-timer-summary = fwupd is installed but its refresh timer is off, so new firmware is not noticed.
